**Shepard** is an autonomous AI maintenance and reliability system for software repositories.

It connects to a repository, learns how the application is supposed to work, establishes a healthy baseline, and continuously audits both the codebase and running product for regressions, failures, and unexpected behavior.

Shepard investigates what it finds, maintains persistent knowledge of the application and its history, tracks overall system health, and alerts you when something actually requires attention.

The philosophy is simple: **don’t watch Shepard. Shepard watches your software.**
